+// go-live (§3.5): a fulfilment already in flight continues from what its records show. A reserved item, a charge or a
+// booked shipment in the records is a step that committed; the first step not shown is issued with its own key, which
+// the system answers with the original result if it had already committed (§1).
+function adoptFulfilment(input, st) {
